  "module_docs": [
    "Port of `net.minestom.server.network.packet.server.play.TeamsPacket` and",
    "every record nested in it (`Settings`, `CreateTeamAction`,",
    "`RemoveTeamAction`, `UpdateTeamAction`, `AddEntitiesToTeamAction`,",
    "`RemoveEntitiesToTeamAction`, `NameTagVisibility`, `CollisionRule`).",
    "",
    "[`Component`] is [`crate::text::Component`], adventure's component tree \u2014",
    "the same type Java's records hold. It travels with [`Component::write`] /",
    "[`Component::read`] (see [`crate::adventure::component_network`]).",
    "",
    "- `TeamColor` comes from the ported `color` module; Java's",
    "  `TeamColor.NETWORK_TYPE` is `NetworkBuffer.Enum(TeamColor.class)`, i.e.",
    "  the var-int ordinal.",
    "- `NameTagVisibility` / `CollisionRule` are declared here rather than reused",
    "  from `scoreboard::team`: the ported `scoreboard` variants model",
    "  `net.minestom.server.scoreboard.Team`'s enums, which carry the same four",
    "  constants in the same order but are a different Java type. Only the",
    "  ordinals matter on the wire, and both enums declare the same order."
  ],
